00:57:22.410 --> 00:57:32.510
<v Driver>I've been trying to call this number for two hours. I'm in traffic right now. I am in traffic. I'm on my way back now. I'm leaving. And damn it, I'm crotchety.
<v Driver>我两小时来一直在打这个号码。我现在在交通拥堵中。我在拥堵中。我正在回去的路上。我要走了。该死的，我很暴躁。

00:57:32.510 --> 00:57:48.040
